{
  "about": "Performance budgets checked by windows/scripts/perf/check-budgets.ps1 after every windows-perf.yml run. Each key is a metric of results.json; 'statistic' is median (default), p90, min, max or mean; the check fails when the statistic is above 'max'. 'baseline' is what CI measured when the budget was set (run id in 'measuredIn'). A metric a run does not produce is reported as not measured and fails only with \"required\": true. How to change a budget: windows/docs/performance.md, section Budgets.",
